          "filename": "PhilMickelsonTPC18thFairway.jpg",
          "caption": "Leader Phil Mickelson hitting his approach shot to the 18th hole at  TPC at Sawgrass during the final round of the 2007 Players Championship.  This shot ended up very close to the water hazard to the left of the green, but stayed dry.  Mickelson bogeyed the hole but still won the title by two shots.  Playing partner Sean O'Hair had just scored a quadruple bogey 7 on the famous 17th hole to fall well back.Phil Mickelson Final Swing on #18 TPC Sawgrass",
